  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/279/397/spcore_header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"750\" height=\"240\"></p><p>這是我的所有 Forge 模組所使用的核心類別。必須安裝此模組，否則我的模組將無法運行。</p><p>使用此核心的模組：</p><ul><li>EnderChests (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderchests\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curse 連結</a>)</li><li>EnderTanks (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/endertanks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curse 連結</a>)</li><li>MultiBeds (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/multibeds\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curse 連結</a>)</li><li>MultiStorage (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/multistorage\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curse 連結</a>)</li><li>Platforms (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/platforms\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curse 連結</a>)</li><li>Terraqueous (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terraqueous\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curse 連結</a>)</li></ul><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"> </p><blockquote><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>請在 <a href=\"https://github.com/ShetiPhian/Localizations-and-Issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上提交本地化檔案。</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>請勿在評論區回報錯誤，請使用 <a href=\"https://github.com/ShetiPhian/Localizations-and-Issues/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤器</a>。</strong></p></blockquote>",
